 begin="35.231" end="35.515">眼球</span><span begin="35.515" end="35.812">看到</span><span begin="35.812" end="36.350">发抖的</span><span begin="36.350" end="36.747">我</span> <span begin="36.747" end="37.103">是那么的</span><span begin="37.103" end="37.527">丑陋</span></p><p begin="37.527" end="40.098" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.527" end="37.832">于是</span><span begin="37.832" end="38.483">捡起</span><span begin="38.483" end="39.149">地上他那</span><span begin="39.149" end="39.655">第二个钮</span><span begin="39.655" end="40.098">扣</span></p><p begin="40.042" end="42.912" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.042" end="40.767">提醒自己该</span><span begin="40.767" end="41.445">开始懂事</span> <span begin="41.445" end="42.121">不被软性</span><span begin="42.121" end="42.912">药物控制</span></p></div><div begin="42.922" end="52.791" itunes:songPart="PreChorus" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="42.922" end="45.491" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.922" end="43.461">在我的眼里</span><span begin="43.461" end="44.100">懂得拒绝</span><span begin="44.100" end="44.796">才能存活</span><span begin="44.796" end="45.045">下</span><span begin="45.045" end="45.491">来</span></p><p begin="45.501" end="48.220" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.501" end="46.114">活着</span> <span begin="46.114" end="46.800">不是用来</span><span begin="46.800" end="47.123">演一出</span><span begin="47.123" end="47.453">糜烂的</span><span begin="47.453" end="48.220">黑色喜剧</span></p><p begin="48.156" end="50.927" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.156" end="48.775">说不</span> <span begin="48.775" end="49.434">我很后悔</span><span begin="49.434" end="50.039">当初没有</span><span begin="50.039" end="50.427">这样的</span><span begin="50.427" end="50.927">肯定</span></p><p begin="50.800" end="52.791" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.800" end="51.450">说不</span> <span begin="51.450" end="51.800">不代</span><span begin="51.800" end="52.152">表</span><span begin="52.152" end="52.372">懦</span><span begin="52.372" end="52.